=== Out of the heart
--- Out of the Heart [title]
overline: The walk
heading: Out of the Heart
big: Luke 6:45 | mark: of the abundance of the heart his mouth speaketh
center: It is perspective we should all keep in mind. God doesn't care about where you sit in church. But He cares about what's in your heart and how you treat others.
